            },
            {
              "type": "content",
              "txt": "Bagwan Health is home to a major referral centre for people in the community.\n\nIts state of the art clinical services building has been designed to deliver improved healthcare facilities for the community, now and in the future.\n\nBagwan Health facilities include:\n\n• women and children's services\n• allied health services, including myotherapy, rehabilitation clinic and counselling\n• intensive care unit\n• inpatient and day beds for cardiology, cancer and renal patients\n• ATSI liaison services\n• interpreting language services.\n"
            },
