            },
            {
              "type": "header",
              "txt": "Emergency plan"
            },
            {
              "type": "content",
              "txt": "There are many different types of emergency situations, including fire or explosion, dangerous chemical release, medical emergency, natural disaster, bomb threats, violence or robbery. \n       \nBoth employees, patients, and individuals visiting the workplace need to be instructed on emergency procedures and accounted for in the case of an actual evacuation. \n"
            },
            {
              "type": "row",
              "buttons": []
            }
          ],
          "rotateX": "0",
          "rotateY": "-160"
